// Title: Proc Exec Cscript
// Description: Hunts for proc exec cscript
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.005
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Aktivitas administratif rutin yang menjalankan binary tersebut (admin script, scheduled task, software update).
ProcessExecutionEvents | where ProcessName == 'cscript.exe'
